# Security And No-Claim Proof

Negative cases covered by
`packages/parent-domain/tests/app-game-control-platform-authority.test.ts`:

- observe-only cannot execute hard-control adapters;
- manual-required cannot execute adapters;
- not-claimed cannot execute adapters;
- Android hide/suspend cannot claim support without Device Owner or Profile
  Owner proof;
- iOS shield cannot claim support without FamilyControls and ManagedSettings
  proof;
- macOS hard block cannot claim support without MDM, Endpoint Security, or
  System Extension proof;
- Linux hard block cannot claim support without mechanism, distro, and session
  proof;
- duplicate platform/action matrix rows are rejected.

No private paths, command lines, tokens, screenshots, keystrokes, content, or
child activity payloads are introduced by this contract.
